DATA LICENSE

The benchmark data in this repository is derived from CodeContests+,
which is based on Codeforces competition problems.

- Codeforces problems are publicly available for educational and research purposes.
- The test cases and solutions are derived from public submissions.
- This dataset is intended for research purposes only.

When using this data, please cite both this work and the original CodeContests
dataset:

```bibtex
@article{codecontests2022,
  title={Competition-level code generation with AlphaCode},
  author={Li, Yujia and Choi, David and Chung, Junyoung and Kushman, Nate and
